{"about_the_game":"Rose Bullet is a Highly stylized, Comic-Style, Retro gameplay, Horror RPG!<br><br>\u2666 STORY:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677950/extras/6394df6966a260ff835b12614eba1849.avif?t=1702326564\" width=600 height=332 /></span><br>Play as a vampire hunter on his way to kill the count and avenge his lost lover.<br>Challenge fate while exploring the deadly manor, Slay creatures of the night in turn-based combat, overcome death, and unlock several different endings!<br><br>\u2666 GAMEPLAY:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677950/extras/9056667108ae371d40fbfc72c1e7f2ea.avif?t=1702326564\" width=600 height=332 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677950/extras/8b9caa8dc949770f933a257242d307a8.avif?t=1702326564\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>Rose Bullet features a mix of Point-and-Click and RPG gameplay!<br><br>\u2666 COMBAT:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677950/extras/bb4a90b97ba436b010d4c51659c5cbee.avif?t=1702326564\" width=600 height=332 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677950/extras/02676968788aa52d0045e8a5ad2dbd80.avif?t=1702326564\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677950/extras/53dec7e21eebd5498b9428f426abaa69.avif?t=1702326564\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677950/extras/7215ee66568ac84ccc35580cd09969be.avif?t=17023265